From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:33:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0990/3799] soh: rename func_8001E1C8 -> EnItem00_Falling

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: falling action: trails small KiraKira sparkles, bounces at 0.8 restitution on contact and returns to the grounded action once the impact is soft enough.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c b/soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c
index c0dee4b49..55df0e968 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c
@@ -15,7 +15,8 @@ void EnItem00_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8001DFC8: the resting action: spins rupees, flips the shield drops, counts the despawn timers down and hands off to the falling action whenever the drop leaves the ground.
 void EnItem00_Grounded(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_8001DFC8 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_8001E1C8(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8001E1C8: falling action: trails small KiraKira sparkles, bounces at 0.8 restitution on contact and returns to the grounded action once the impact is soft enough.
+void EnItem00_Falling(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_8001E1C8 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_8001E304(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play);
 // Name from zeldaret/oot (was func_8001E5C8): adopted upstream's name for this address; body verified to match upstream at 0.94. [oot: https://github.com/zeldaret/oot/blob/main/src/code/z_en_item00.c]
 void EnItem00_Collected(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play);
@@ -637,11 +638,11 @@ void EnItem00_Grounded(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 
     if ((this->actor.gravity != 0.0f) && !(this->actor.bgCheckFlags & 0x0001)) {
-        EnItem00_SetupAction(this, func_8001E1C8);
+        EnItem00_SetupAction(this, EnItem00_Falling);  // was func_8001E1C8 [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 }
 
-void func_8001E1C8(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play) {
+void EnItem00_Falling(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play) {
     f32 originalVelocity;
     Vec3f effectPos;
 
